2026-07-27T08:51:22.7654881Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7655619Z i /tmp/RtmpFQJB3S/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7656019Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7656485Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7657221Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7658160Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7659107Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:51:22.7659827Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
